{"_v":4,"id":"legally-blonde-2007","cat":"broadway","cs":64.24,"rc":5,"bd":{"rave":0,"positive":3,"mixed":1,"negative":1},"rv":[{"cn":"Linda Winer","o":"Newsday","s":74,"b":"Positive","t":1,"v":"positive","u":"https://www.newspapers.com/image/713949772/","d":"2007-04-30","q":"After all, Mitchell choreographed such long-running, crowd-pleasing adaptations as \"Hairspray\" and \"The Full Monty.\" With \"Legally Blonde,\" his directing debut, he takes the logical well- step from moving bodies to energizing the total vision. Everything gets moved - except, you know, your heart.","tc":1},{"cn":"Ben Brantley","o":"The New York Times","s":58,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"v":"mixed","u":"https://www.nytimes.com/2007/04/30/theater/reviews/30blon.html","d":"2007-04-30","q":"This high-energy, empty-calories and expensive-looking hymn to the glories of girlishness...approximates the experience of eating a jumbo box of Gummi Bears in one sitting.","tc":1},{"cn":"Barry Gordin and Patrick Christiano","o":"Theater Life","s":79,"b":"Positive","t":2,"v":"positive","u":"https://theaterlife.com/legally-blonde-2/","d":"2007-06-16","q":"Legally Blonde is destined to be a long running hit."},{"cn":null,"o":"TheaterMania","s":76,"b":"Positive","t":2,"v":"positive","u":"https://www.theatermania.com/news/legally-blonde_10586/","d":"2007-04-23","q":"Omigod, you guys. For better or worse, Legally Blonde is a hit!"},{"cn":"Matthew Murray","o":"Talkin' Broadway","s":35,"b":"Negative","t":2,"v":"negative","u":"https://www.talkinbroadway.com/world/LegallyBlonde.html","d":"2007-05-06","q":"The same can't be said of much else in Legally Blonde."}],"au":{"score":86.93,"designation":"Liking","sources":{"mz":{"s":87,"c":372,"sr":4.3},"ss":{"s":84,"c":9,"u":"https://www.show-score.com/broadway-shows/legally-blonde"}}},"tn":[{"yr":61,"cat":"Best Book of a Musical","n":"Heather Hach"},{"yr":61,"cat":"Best Original Score","n":"Laurence O'Keefe"},{"yr":61,"cat":"Best Original Score","n":"Nell Benjamin"},{"yr":61,"cat"